                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The main selling point of There Came an Echo is the voice commands, and ironically, that's also its biggest flaw. The voice recognition is awful. It constantly fails to understand commands, even when speaking clearly, which is especially frustrating when you need to react quickly.\r\n\r\nMy microphone works perfectly (even tried to record myself), and I even tested multiple microphones to make sure. The problem is the game's voice recognition which simply sucks real hard.",
